  "solution": {
    "text": "The electric field at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> is superposition of the fields due to all four charges. The electric field due to the two <math><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> charges is<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0184_aba34881fc99.png\" /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />The field due to <math><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> is towards right and the field due to <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> is towards left. Also <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> .<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#8776;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8776;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>"
